proton-pass-cli — how to re-pin
  1. New release: https://github.com/protonpass/pass-cli/releases — set pkgver to the tag.
  2. Resolve the tag to a commit (GitHub → tag → commit sha) and put it in the comment above source=.
  3. `updpkgsums` recomputes b2sums from the fresh checkout; keep it (never SKIP).
